# {{ .Name }} ({{ .Type }})

{{ .Description | trimspace }}

Its purpose is scoping a rule to your own address: let me in, and nobody else. It is not necessarily
your public address. It is your address on whatever network you reached the API over, so behind a
corporate VPN it is the VPN address, which is usually the useful answer, since that is also the
address a machine sees.

